
# The VM tree is checked out onto Linux and deployed verbatim. A CRLF here is
# not cosmetic: a shell script with CRLF line endings fails with the famously
# unhelpful "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M", and a systemd unit with
# them is silently mis-parsed. This repo is edited from Windows, so pin it.
vm/** text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
